! core2 — AS65300 internal core router  (Arista EOS)
! Role: redundant core router, no directly attached servers
!
! Links:
!   Ethernet1: 10.255.2.2/30   (to edge)
!   Ethernet2: 10.255.3.2/30   (to core1)
!   Loopback0: 10.0.0.3/32
!
hostname core2
!
interface Loopback0
   ip address 10.0.0.3/32
!
interface Ethernet1
   description to-edge  10.255.2.0/30
   no switchport
   ip address 10.255.2.2/30
   no shutdown
!
interface Ethernet2
   description to-core1  10.255.3.0/30
   no switchport
   ip address 10.255.3.2/30
   no shutdown
!
ip routing
!
! ================================================
! core2  —  Capstone Tasks
!
! Role: Redundant core OSPF area 0 router
!
! Task 1 — OSPF Area 0
!   Both Ethernet interfaces active. Advertise loopback + both links in area 0.
!   Hint:
!     router ospf 1
!        router-id 10.0.0.3
!        passive-interface default
!        no passive-interface Ethernet1
!        no passive-interface Ethernet2
!        network 10.0.0.3/32 area 0.0.0.0
!        network 10.255.2.0/30 area 0.0.0.0
!        network 10.255.3.0/30 area 0.0.0.0
! ================================================
!
end
